(a) No original license shall be issued hereunder where the place of business is located as follows:
(1) Within 100 feet of any private residence as measured in any direction, unless such residence is itself in a commercial district or mixed use district; however, should the proposed premises be located on a corner, said distance from the nearest point of any residential building in the rear of the proposed premises on the side street shall be no less than 50 feet;
